{"slug":"hh-y-y","ar":"ح ي ي","total":184,"core":"life; modesty","forms":[{"ar":"حَيَوٰة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":76,"gloss":"life","word":null,"ex":{"s":79,"a":38,"p":2,"ar":["وَءَاثَرَ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ","ٱلدُّنْيَا"],"en":"And preferred the life of the world"}},{"ar":"أَحْيَا","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":51,"gloss":"to give life","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":81,"p":4,"ar":["وَٱلَّذِى","يُمِيتُنِى","ثُمَّ","يُحْيِينِ"],"en":"And who will cause me to die and then bring me to life"}},{"ar":"حَيّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":24,"gloss":"The Ever-Living","word":"al-hayy","ex":{"s":77,"a":26,"p":1,"ar":["أَحْيَآءً","وَأَمْوَٰتًا"],"en":"Of the living and the dead"}},{"ar":"يَسْتَحْىِۦٓ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":9,"gloss":"to spare alive; to be ashamed","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":49,"p":11,"ar":["وَإِذْ","نَجَّيْنَـٰكُم","مِّنْ","ءَالِ","فِرْعَوْنَ","يَسُومُونَكُمْ","سُوٓءَ","ٱلْعَذَابِ","يُذَبِّحُونَ","أَبْنَآءَكُمْ","وَيَسْتَحْيُونَ","نِسَآءَكُمْ ۚ","وَفِى","ذَٰلِكُم","بَلَآءٌ","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","عَظِيمٌ"],"en":"And [recall] when We saved your forefathers from the people of Pharaoh, who afflicted you with the worst torment, slaughtering your [newborn] sons and keeping your females alive. And in that was a great trial from your Lord"}},{"ar":"حَىَّ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":7,"gloss":"to live","word":null,"ex":{"s":87,"a":13,"p":6,"ar":["ثُمَّ","لَا","يَمُوتُ","فِيهَا","وَلَا","يَحْيَىٰ"],"en":"Neither dying therein nor living"}},{"ar":"تَحِيَّة","kind":"verbal noun","form":2,"count":6,"gloss":"greeting","word":null,"ex":{"s":33,"a":44,"p":1,"ar":["تَحِيَّتُهُمْ","يَوْمَ","يَلْقَوْنَهُۥ","سَلَـٰمٌ ۚ","وَأَعَدَّ","لَهُمْ","أَجْرًا","كَرِيمًا"],"en":"Their greeting the Day they meet Him will be, \"Peace.\" And He has prepared for them a noble reward"}},{"ar":"حَيَّ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":4,"gloss":"to greet","word":null,"ex":{"s":4,"a":86,"p":2,"ar":["وَإِذَا","حُيِّيتُم","بِتَحِيَّةٍ","فَحَيُّوا۟","بِأَحْسَنَ","مِنْهَآ","أَوْ","رُدُّوهَآ ۗ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","حَسِيبًا"],"en":"And when you are greeted with a greeting, greet [in return] with one better than it or [at least] return it [in a like manner]. Indeed, Allah is ever, over all things, an Accountant"}},{"ar":"مُحْى","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":2,"gloss":"The Giver of Life","word":"al-muhyi","ex":{"s":30,"a":50,"p":13,"ar":["فَٱنظُرْ","إِلَىٰٓ","ءَاثَـٰرِ","رَحْمَتِ","ٱللَّهِ","كَيْفَ","يُحْىِ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","بَعْدَ","مَوْتِهَآ ۚ","إِنَّ","ذَٰلِكَ","لَمُحْىِ","ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ ۖ","وَهُوَ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","قَدِيرٌ"],"en":"So observe the effects of the mercy of Allah - how He gives life to the earth after its lifelessness. Indeed, that [same one] will give life to the dead, and He is over all things competent"}},{"ar":"مَّحْيَا","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"life, living","word":null,"ex":{"s":6,"a":162,"p":5,"ar":["قُلْ","إِنَّ","صَلَاتِى","وَنُسُكِى","وَمَحْيَاىَ","وَمَمَاتِى","لِلَّهِ","رَبِّ","ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ"],"en":"Say, \"Indeed, my prayer, my rites of sacrifice, my living and my dying are for Allah, Lord of the worlds"}},{"ar":"حَيَوَان","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"true life","word":null,"ex":{"s":29,"a":64,"p":12,"ar":["وَمَا","هَـٰذِهِ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","ٱلدُّنْيَآ","إِلَّا","لَهْوٌ","وَلَعِبٌ ۚ","وَإِنَّ","ٱلدَّارَ","ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ","لَهِىَ","ٱلْحَيَوَانُ ۚ","لَوْ","كَانُوا۟","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"en":"And this worldly life is not but diversion and amusement. And indeed, the home of the Hereafter - that is the [eternal] life, if only they knew"}},{"ar":"حَيَّة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"snake","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":20,"p":4,"ar":["فَأَلْقَىٰهَا","فَإِذَا","هِىَ","حَيَّةٌ","تَسْعَىٰ"],"en":"So he threw it down, and thereupon it was a snake, moving swiftly"}},{"ar":"ٱسْتِحْيَآء","kind":"verbal noun","form":10,"count":1,"gloss":"shyness","word":null,"ex":{"s":28,"a":25,"p":5,"ar":["فَجَآءَتْهُ","إِحْدَىٰهُمَا","تَمْشِى","عَلَى","ٱسْتِحْيَآءٍ","قَالَتْ","إِنَّ","أَبِى","يَدْعُوكَ","لِيَجْزِيَكَ","أَجْرَ","مَا","سَقَيْتَ","لَنَا ۚ","فَلَمَّا","جَآءَهُۥ","وَقَصَّ","عَلَيْهِ","ٱلْقَصَصَ","قَالَ","لَا","تَخَفْ ۖ","نَجَوْتَ","مِنَ","ٱلْقَوْمِ","ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ"],"en":"Then one of the two women came to him walking with shyness. She said, \"Indeed, my father invites you that he may reward you for having watered for us.\" So when he came to him and related to him the story, he said, \"Fear not. You have escaped from the wrongdoing people"}}],"surahs":[[2,19],[10,10],[3,9],[6,8],[30,8],[7,7],[4,6],[20,6],[40,6],[45,6],[16,5],[28,5],[36,5],[9,4],[14,4],[18,4],[19,4],[23,4],[25,4],[29,4],[33,4],[41,4],[57,4],[8,3],[13,3],[22,3],[35,3],[5,2],[24,2],[42,2],[43,2],[46,2],[50,2],[53,2],[58,2],[87,2],[11,1],[15,1],[17,1],[21,1],[26,1],[31,1],[39,1],[44,1],[47,1],[67,1],[75,1],[77,1],[79,1],[89,1]]}